---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['worcester-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Worcester County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Worcester County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Experienced Legal Representation in Worcester County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Worcester County is home to Ocean City, one of the East Coast's most popular beach 
    destinations, as well as the charming communities of Berlin and Snow Hill. The influx 
    of millions of summer visitors creates unique legal challenges. Attorney Alex Poberesky 
    provides experienced representation to Worcester County residents and visitors alike.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Worcester County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Ocean City's busy summer season brings crowded boardwalks, heavy beach traffic, and 
    increased risk of accidents. Whether you're a year-round resident or a visitor who was 
    injured while vacationing, you deserve experienced legal representation to help you 
    recover compensation for your injuries.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle personal injury cases throughout Worcester County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Route 50 and Coastal Highway</li>
    <li>Pedestrian accidents on the Ocean City Boardwalk</li>
    <li>Bicycle accidents</li>
    <li>Hotel and rental property slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Beach and water-related injuries</li>
    <li>Boating accidents in the bay and ocean</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at Atlantic General Hospital</li>
    <li>Amusement ride and attraction injuries</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Worcester County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Summer crowds in Ocean City mean increased law enforcement activity. If you've been 
    arrested for DUI, drug possession, assault, or other offenses, you need experienced 
    defense. We represent both residents and out-of-state visitors facing charges in 
    Worcester County.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Representing Visitors and Residents</h3>
  
  <p>
    We understand that many Worcester County injury victims and defendants are visitors 
    from other states. We work with out-of-state clients to handle their cases efficiently, 
    minimizing the need for multiple trips to Maryland while ensuring their cases receive 
    the attention they deserve.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Worcester County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Worcester County, including Ocean City, Berlin, 
    Snow Hill, Pocomoke City, Ocean Pines, and surrounding areas. Contact us today for 
    a free consultation.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
